2
00:00:11,886 --> 00:00:14,806
Guys, kailangan n'yong galingan

3
00:00:14,889 --> 00:00:17,017
kung gusto n'yo uling
talunin ang Aurelita.

4
00:00:17,600 --> 00:00:20,854
Determinado silang makabawi.
Sa home court nila gaganapin ang game.

5
00:00:20,937 --> 00:00:24,733
Di porke natalo natin sila,
di na tayo mag-e-effort ngayon.

6
00:00:25,316 --> 00:00:27,861
Dapat galingan n'yo pa ring lahat.

7
00:00:28,737 --> 00:00:31,239
Umuwi at magpahinga na kayo.
Bukas na lang ulit.

8
00:00:31,322 --> 00:00:33,158
-Tara, guys.
-Thanks, Coach.

9
00:00:33,241 --> 00:00:34,159
Thanks, Coach.

10
00:00:36,286 --> 00:00:37,162
Okay.

11
00:00:45,211 --> 00:00:46,713
May pag-asa kaya tayo?

12
00:00:46,796 --> 00:00:49,257
Kung gagalingan pa rin ni Dylan,
may pag-asa tayo.

13
00:00:50,383 --> 00:00:53,636
Ewan ko kung paano
nakumbinsi ng tatay niya

14
00:00:53,720 --> 00:00:57,307
si Principal Whitmore para
makapaglaro siya, pero mabuti na rin 'yon.

15
00:00:57,390 --> 00:01:00,643
No'ng nawala ka sa team,
siya na lang ang meron kami.

16
00:01:14,949 --> 00:01:19,037
Tumutulong ako sa pag-aayos ng food stall,
so nando'n na ako by 2:00 p.m.

17
00:01:19,120 --> 00:01:21,623
Okay. Tutulong ako
kung paano ang magiging ayos.

18
00:01:21,706 --> 00:01:23,500
Di na. Kami na doon.

19
00:01:23,583 --> 00:01:25,627
Planado na ni Papa ang lahat.

20
00:01:25,710 --> 00:01:27,504
Nando'n lang ako as backup.

21
00:01:27,587 --> 00:01:29,672
Okay, sabay tayong pumunta do'n.

22
00:01:29,756 --> 00:01:33,176
Sige. Ay, maaga pala ako do'n.
Aayusin ko pa 'yong church raffle.

23
00:01:33,259 --> 00:01:36,930
-Tutulungan kita. Anong oras?
-Marami naman kaming volunteers.

24
00:01:37,013 --> 00:01:39,974
Magkita na lang tayo pagdating mo doon.
Mag-relax ka na lang.

25
00:01:40,058 --> 00:01:42,018
Oo nga. Mag-enjoy ka na lang.

26
00:01:43,061 --> 00:01:44,604
-Okay.
-Ano'ng problema?

27
00:01:45,105 --> 00:01:47,774
Naghahanap lang siguro ako ng distraction.

28
00:01:47,857 --> 00:01:50,693
Kinakabahan ako
dahil bukas na ang driver's test ko.

29
00:01:50,777 --> 00:01:52,112
Dapat pumasa ako.

30
00:01:52,195 --> 00:01:53,446
Papasa ka. Kaya mo 'yan.

31
00:01:54,197 --> 00:01:55,031
Sana nga.

32
00:01:55,615 --> 00:01:57,033
-Aalis na 'ko.
-Ako rin.

33
00:01:57,117 --> 00:01:58,993
-Okay. Sige.
-Kaya mo 'yan, Jackie.

34
00:01:59,869 --> 00:02:00,870
-Bye.
-Bye.

35
00:02:21,599 --> 00:02:22,475
Ano'ng masasabi mo?

36
00:02:23,143 --> 00:02:24,477
Alam mo, Walter?

37
00:02:24,561 --> 00:02:26,563
Rider na rider ka na talaga.

38
00:02:26,646 --> 00:02:27,897
Nakakabilib ka.

39
00:02:29,023 --> 00:02:33,069
Ready na kaya ako para sa tryouts bukas?

40
00:02:33,153 --> 00:02:35,155
Kailangan ko 'yong sponsorship na 'yon.

41
00:02:35,238 --> 00:02:37,699
Oo. Di kita isasalang kung di ka pa ready.

42
00:02:37,782 --> 00:02:39,617
Nakataya din dito ang pangalan ko, 'no.

43
00:02:41,995 --> 00:02:44,372
Ang laki ng improvement mo, Alex Walter.

44
00:02:45,206 --> 00:02:48,168
Well, salamat sa tulong mo.

45
00:02:48,251 --> 00:02:51,004
Salamat sa credit,
pero nag-effort ka rin naman

46
00:02:51,087 --> 00:02:53,214
kahit maaga at mahaba ang trainings mo.

47
00:02:53,298 --> 00:02:56,384
Kahit i-train kita,
nasa sa 'yo pa rin kung mag-i-improve ka.

48
00:02:57,177 --> 00:02:58,845
Nagawa mo 'yon.

49
00:03:00,847 --> 00:03:02,682
Bakit parang nagpapaalam ka na?

50
00:03:03,558 --> 00:03:07,687
Pag naging sponsor mo si Papa,
di na ako ang trainer mo.

51
00:03:14,068 --> 00:03:15,320
Nakakatawa 'yon.

52
00:03:18,489 --> 00:03:20,742
Mamaya na lang ulit, guys.

53
00:03:24,120 --> 00:03:25,330
Bakit nandito ka pa?

54
00:03:26,497 --> 00:03:29,167
Tinatapos ko pa 'tong
pambenta ko sa Sparkle bukas.

55
00:03:29,667 --> 00:03:30,501
Cute.

56
00:03:32,795 --> 00:03:35,173
So, ayaw mo pa rin pala akong kausapin?

57
00:03:40,595 --> 00:03:42,138
Ano ba'ng gusto mong sabihin ko?

58
00:03:43,932 --> 00:03:48,645
Sinubukan mong dayain 'yong drug test
at sinuhulan ng papa mo ang principal.

59
00:03:48,728 --> 00:03:50,480
Di siya nanuhol.

60
00:03:50,563 --> 00:03:52,941
Pero dahil do'n, di ka napanagot, di ba?

61
00:03:54,108 --> 00:03:55,944
Desperado na ako.

62
00:03:56,027 --> 00:03:58,738
Pag di ako nakapaglaro,
di ako makakapasok sa showcase.

63
00:03:58,821 --> 00:04:01,449
Pag nangyari 'yon,
di ako makakapag-football sa college.

64
00:04:01,532 --> 00:04:06,162
Baka di na ako pansinin
ng tatay ko hanggang sa mag-40 ako.

65
00:04:06,996 --> 00:04:07,956
So?

66
00:04:08,748 --> 00:04:11,668
'Yon lang ba ang mahalaga?
Ang maging good boy para sa kanya?

67
00:04:13,169 --> 00:04:14,963
Bakit di ka mangatuwiran sa kanya?

68
00:04:15,046 --> 00:04:17,006
Ayaw mo bang magdesisyon
para sa sarili mo?

69
00:04:19,092 --> 00:04:20,426
Di ko alam kung kaya ko 'yon.

70
00:04:23,972 --> 00:04:25,390
Tatapusin ko pa 'to.

71
00:04:53,084 --> 00:04:53,960
Ang galing mo.

72
00:04:55,044 --> 00:04:56,921
-Kayang-kaya mo na.
-Talaga?

73
00:04:57,588 --> 00:04:58,881
Oo naman.

74
00:04:59,549 --> 00:05:01,592
Papasa ka na, sure ako 100%.

75
00:05:02,885 --> 00:05:04,095
Positive vibes only.

76
00:05:04,178 --> 00:05:05,013
Okay.

77
00:05:06,973 --> 00:05:08,641
-Hi, anak.
-Hi.

78
00:05:09,726 --> 00:05:10,560
Hi.

79
00:05:12,103 --> 00:05:13,021
Kumusta?

80
00:05:14,314 --> 00:05:15,189
Ayos lang.

81
00:05:16,858 --> 00:05:18,318
Big game na bukas.

82
00:05:19,360 --> 00:05:20,194
Oo.

83
00:05:20,778 --> 00:05:21,988
Kayang-kaya mo 'yon.

84
00:05:32,290 --> 00:05:35,501
Bihira na kitang makita
simula no'ng Halloween.

85
00:05:37,670 --> 00:05:39,172
Oo, alam ko.

86
00:05:40,048 --> 00:05:43,176
May trabaho ako, nagko-coach ako,
nag-aaral ako. Medyo…

87
00:05:43,259 --> 00:05:46,054
Natanggap mo na ba
'yong new SAT scores mo?

88
00:05:46,721 --> 00:05:47,555
Hindi.

89
00:05:49,015 --> 00:05:51,601
Dapat natanggap mo na 'yon.
Tawagan mo sila.

90
00:05:51,684 --> 00:05:54,479
Oo, tama ka. Tatawag ako. Thanks.

91
00:05:57,273 --> 00:05:58,358
Sabay tayong mag-aayos

92
00:05:58,441 --> 00:06:00,526
ng college application, di ba?
Gawin na natin?

93
00:06:01,444 --> 00:06:03,321
Di na. Okay na 'yon.

94
00:06:03,404 --> 00:06:06,157
Wala na tayong oras.

95
00:06:06,240 --> 00:06:09,202
-Ire-review ko bago mo ipasa…
-Wag mo na 'yong isipin.

96
00:06:10,119 --> 00:06:14,040
Tatapusin ko pa 'tong game play namin.
Big day na bukas.

97
00:06:15,124 --> 00:06:16,042
So.

98
00:06:17,502 --> 00:06:19,212
Okay. Good luck.

99
00:06:20,630 --> 00:06:21,631
Oo.

100
00:06:23,007 --> 00:06:23,841
Ikaw rin.

101
00:06:52,328 --> 00:06:54,205
-Hi.
-Oh my God.

102
00:06:54,288 --> 00:06:55,581
Surprise!

103
00:06:58,626 --> 00:07:00,962
Mali ba ang unawa ko?
Akala ko next week ka pa uuwi?

104
00:07:01,045 --> 00:07:04,757
Hindi. No'ng nakausap kita,
parang kailangan mo na talaga ng yakap.

105
00:07:04,841 --> 00:07:08,261
So sinabi ko kay Felix
na aagahan ko ang uwi ko, kaya eto.

106
00:07:13,808 --> 00:07:16,394
Grabe, sobra kitang na-miss.

107
00:07:23,818 --> 00:07:24,944
Okay.

108
00:07:26,487 --> 00:07:27,488
Good luck.

109
00:07:31,075 --> 00:07:32,952
Sige na. Kaya mo 'yan.

110
00:07:33,035 --> 00:07:35,496
Hihintayin kita hanggang sa matapos ka.

111
00:07:36,831 --> 00:07:37,665
Pangako.

112
00:07:37,748 --> 00:07:38,583
Okay.

113
00:07:43,296 --> 00:07:44,630
Sisiw sa 'yo 'yon.

114
00:07:53,222 --> 00:07:54,307
Good to see you.

115
00:07:59,645 --> 00:08:01,189
Ang daming riders dito.

116
00:08:01,272 --> 00:08:03,232
Akala mo ba lamang ka dahil tinrain kita?

117
00:08:03,816 --> 00:08:05,067
Wag kang mayabang.

118
00:08:05,151 --> 00:08:07,528
Di 'to madali. Malaking bagay 'to.

119
00:08:07,612 --> 00:08:12,116
Matrabaho 'to pag napili ka.
Mas matindi 'to sa ginagawa mo ngayon.

120
00:08:12,200 --> 00:08:14,744
May mga gabi
at weekend na wala ka sa inyo.

121
00:08:14,827 --> 00:08:17,288
Sure ka bang eto ang gusto mo?
Kasi kung hindi…

122
00:08:17,371 --> 00:08:18,539
Oo, eto ang gusto ko.

123
00:08:20,374 --> 00:08:22,835
Matutuwa kaya dito si Jackie?

124
00:08:24,170 --> 00:08:25,922
-Ano'ng ibig mong sabihin?
-Alex naman.

125
00:08:26,005 --> 00:08:27,089
Alam kong kayo na.

126
00:08:27,173 --> 00:08:29,383
Ang di ko gets,
bakit parang nililihim n'yo?

127
00:08:29,467 --> 00:08:30,676
Saan ka ba natatakot?

128
00:08:30,760 --> 00:08:33,221
Di ako natatakot. It's complicated.

129
00:08:33,304 --> 00:08:35,181
Kung gusto mo 'tong ituloy,

130
00:08:35,264 --> 00:08:36,849
dapat alam mong di madaling

131
00:08:36,933 --> 00:08:39,477
makipagrelasyon sa taong
di part ng mundo natin,

132
00:08:39,560 --> 00:08:41,354
kahit na matibay pa ang relasyon n'yo.

133
00:08:41,437 --> 00:08:42,813
-So, kung di…
-Matibay kami.

134
00:08:44,649 --> 00:08:46,359
So wala kang dapat alalahanin.

135
00:08:47,360 --> 00:08:48,194
Sige.

136
00:08:49,904 --> 00:08:50,863
Tara na, cowboy.

137
00:08:58,788 --> 00:08:59,664
Ready ka na?

138
00:09:00,289 --> 00:09:02,583
Well, malalaman natin.

139
00:09:05,836 --> 00:09:08,548
Isaac, okay ka lang? Okay, game na.

140
00:09:09,048 --> 00:09:09,882
Uy, Cole.

141
00:09:10,800 --> 00:09:13,469
Ganito, di ako maglalaro today.

142
00:09:14,637 --> 00:09:16,097
Ano'ng ibig mong sabihin?

143
00:09:16,180 --> 00:09:18,266
Papanagutan ko 'yong pagkakamali ko.

144
00:09:18,349 --> 00:09:20,226
Di pwedeng si Papa ang umayos ng mali ko.

145
00:09:21,769 --> 00:09:23,938
Alam kong wrong timing 'tong desisyon ko.

146
00:09:24,522 --> 00:09:25,856
Alam mo naman pala eh.

147
00:09:25,940 --> 00:09:26,774
Sorry.

148
00:09:27,900 --> 00:09:30,361
Ayoko sanang gawin 'to sa team natin,

149
00:09:30,444 --> 00:09:33,573
pero maling pumayag ako
sa ginawa ng tatay ko.

150
00:09:35,074 --> 00:09:37,201
Pinipilit ko lang gawin 'yong tama.

151
00:09:37,285 --> 00:09:39,036
Huli na para gawin 'yan.

152
00:09:39,620 --> 00:09:43,874
Oo. Pero para kay Isaac 'tong larong 'to.

153
00:09:43,958 --> 00:09:47,336
Dylan, division finals na.
Kailangan ka ng team.

154
00:09:48,421 --> 00:09:49,255
Mali.

155
00:09:50,339 --> 00:09:51,549
Ikaw ang kailangan nila.

156
00:10:05,187 --> 00:10:06,022
Salamat.

157
00:10:07,773 --> 00:10:09,108
-Yehey!
-Pasado ako!

158
00:10:10,735 --> 00:10:12,820
Yehey! Sabi ko na nga ba magagawa mo.

159
00:10:17,283 --> 00:10:18,784
Oh my God. 'Yon ba 'yong…

160
00:10:18,868 --> 00:10:20,620
Oo. Kotse 'yon ng mama mo.

161
00:10:21,704 --> 00:10:23,873
Pinadala 'yan dito ni Richard
galing New York.

162
00:10:23,956 --> 00:10:25,625
-Salamat.
-You're welcome.

163
00:10:27,001 --> 00:10:29,086
Paano pala kung bumagsak ulit ako?

164
00:10:29,170 --> 00:10:31,005
Alam naming di ka babagsak.

165
00:10:31,922 --> 00:10:35,593
Pero kung bumagsak ka,
itatago ulit namin 'yon sa garahe ni Tony.

166
00:10:36,969 --> 00:10:38,095
Okay.

167
00:10:39,388 --> 00:10:40,348
Sige na.

168
00:10:42,224 --> 00:10:43,059
Salamat.

169
00:10:43,142 --> 00:10:44,852
You're welcome. Mag-enjoy ka.

170
00:10:46,479 --> 00:10:47,355
Mag-iingat ka.

171
00:11:16,634 --> 00:11:19,053
Di talaga siya maglalaro.
So si Isaac na talaga.

172
00:11:19,136 --> 00:11:20,763
Okay, guys, makinig.

173
00:11:22,139 --> 00:11:24,642
Isaac, mag-warm ka ng braso.

174
00:11:24,725 --> 00:11:27,311
-Bakit po?
-Ikaw ang quarterback today.

175
00:11:27,395 --> 00:11:31,691
Di maglalaro ngayon si Newsome.

176
00:11:33,067 --> 00:11:33,984
Coach!

177
00:11:34,068 --> 00:11:37,279
Okay, huminahon kayo. Kaya natin 'to.

178
00:11:37,363 --> 00:11:40,116
Gusto niyang pagbayaran
'yong suspension niya.

179
00:11:41,242 --> 00:11:43,994
Sige na, guys. Galingan n'yo na lang.

180
00:11:45,121 --> 00:11:49,458
Ibigay n'yo ang best n'yo. Sige na.
Okay? Let's go!

181
00:11:49,542 --> 00:11:51,419
Ipapanalo pa natin 'tong labang 'to.

182
00:11:57,216 --> 00:11:58,050
Dylan.

183
00:12:00,052 --> 00:12:01,345
Ano ba'ng pinaggagawa mo?

184
00:12:03,639 --> 00:12:04,890
Suspended ako, Papa.

185
00:12:05,725 --> 00:12:06,976
-Di ako dapat maglaro.
-Ano?

186
00:12:07,059 --> 00:12:09,979
Pagkatapos ng ginawa ko
para lang maibalik ka sa team?

187
00:12:10,062 --> 00:12:12,523
-Akala mo ba madali 'yon?
-Alam ko po.

188
00:12:13,524 --> 00:12:14,525
Sorry po talaga.

189
00:12:15,484 --> 00:12:20,281
Bagsak ako sa drug test, pero nagbayad ka
para lang makapaglaro ako, mali 'yon.

190
00:12:21,198 --> 00:12:22,158
Nagkamali ako.

191
00:12:23,159 --> 00:12:26,162
Dapat panagutan ko 'yon. Kung hindi…

192
00:12:26,954 --> 00:12:29,623
-Ano pang saysay nito?
-Ang mahalaga, makapaglaro ka.

193
00:12:29,707 --> 00:12:32,585
-May pagkakataon kang maging pro.
-Pangarap mo po 'yon.

194
00:12:34,462 --> 00:12:35,671
Di ko pangarap 'yon.

195
00:12:36,672 --> 00:12:39,717
Sorry po kasi di n'yo naabot
'yong pangarap n'yo.

196
00:12:41,343 --> 00:12:43,012
Pero di po eto ang gusto ko.

197
00:12:45,097 --> 00:12:46,474
Di sa ganitong paraan.

198
00:12:54,148 --> 00:12:55,065
Alam mo?

199
00:12:58,569 --> 00:13:00,905
Siguro nga di ka karapat-dapat sa D1.

200
00:13:24,470 --> 00:13:26,263
-Ikaw na, Alex.
-Wag kang mag-alala.

201
00:13:27,223 --> 00:13:28,224
Kaya ko 'to.

202
00:14:07,054 --> 00:14:07,888
Hut!

203
00:14:09,348 --> 00:14:11,225
Garcia, ipasa mo sa kanya 'yong bola.

204
00:14:11,308 --> 00:14:14,144
Di pa ready 'yong pinsan mo.

205
00:14:16,981 --> 00:14:18,649
Sasagutin ko lang 'to.

206
00:14:19,525 --> 00:14:22,194
Honey, okay ka lang ba?
Nasa game kami ngayon.

207
00:14:22,987 --> 00:14:24,947
Ano? Gaano kadalas ang contractions mo?

208
00:14:25,030 --> 00:14:27,700
Okay. Papunta na 'ko diyan.

209
00:14:28,576 --> 00:14:30,202
Tawagan mo rin ang mama mo!

210
00:14:32,079 --> 00:14:34,748
Nagle-labor na ang asawa ko.

211
00:14:34,832 --> 00:14:37,501
-Kailangan ko nang umalis.
-Pero paano 'tong game?

212
00:14:37,585 --> 00:14:39,211
Ikaw na ang bahala dito.

213
00:14:39,295 --> 00:14:41,422
-Di ko 'to kaya.
-Kaya mo 'yan.

214
00:14:41,505 --> 00:14:43,883
Gawin mo lang
'yong ginagawa natin sa practice.

215
00:14:43,966 --> 00:14:46,844
Palakasin mo ang loob nila.
Inaasahan kita.

216
00:14:47,428 --> 00:14:48,429
Inaasahan ka namin.

217
00:15:03,277 --> 00:15:05,654
Congratulations, driver.

218
00:15:05,738 --> 00:15:06,906
Ang ganda ng car mo.

219
00:15:06,989 --> 00:15:09,116
Salamat. Sa nanay ko 'to.

220
00:15:09,992 --> 00:15:12,036
Bagay sa 'yo 'yan. Patulong naman ako.

221
00:15:12,119 --> 00:15:13,537
Sige.

222
00:15:14,079 --> 00:15:15,581
So, ano'ng sabi sa 'yo ni Alex?

223
00:15:16,415 --> 00:15:19,585
Di muna namin ite-text
at kakausapin ang isa't isa

224
00:15:19,668 --> 00:15:21,211
para di kami mahalata.

225
00:15:21,295 --> 00:15:23,464
Okay. Pero ilang linggo na rin kayo.

226
00:15:23,547 --> 00:15:25,799
Kailan n'yo planong sabihin sa iba 'yan?

227
00:15:26,550 --> 00:15:28,385
Ewan ko. Malapit na rin siguro.

228
00:15:29,303 --> 00:15:31,931
Akala ko nag-I love you
na kayo sa isa't isa,

229
00:15:32,014 --> 00:15:34,808
so di ko gets
kung bakit nililihim n'yo pa 'yan.

230
00:15:37,102 --> 00:15:38,437
Dahil ba kay Cole?

231
00:15:38,938 --> 00:15:39,772
Hindi.

232
00:15:40,898 --> 00:15:44,234
Pero ang weird ng inaasta ni Cole lately.

233
00:15:45,027 --> 00:15:47,279
Sabay dapat kaming gagawa
ng college applications,

234
00:15:47,363 --> 00:15:50,616
pero lagi siyang na kay Tony
o sa football.

235
00:15:50,699 --> 00:15:53,285
Nag-aalala ako,
baka di siya umabot sa deadline.

236
00:15:53,369 --> 00:15:55,454
Akala ko rin nag-retake na siya ng SATs,

237
00:15:55,537 --> 00:15:57,706
pero wala pa rin daw result,

238
00:15:57,790 --> 00:16:00,376
so di ko sure kung nag-retake talaga siya.

239
00:16:00,459 --> 00:16:03,587
Baka nahihiya siyang sabihin sa 'yo
kasi bumagsak ulit siya?

240
00:16:03,671 --> 00:16:05,714
Di naman siguro siya magsisinungaling.

241
00:16:06,465 --> 00:16:09,760
Jackie, bakit ka ba
nag-aalala sa future ni Cole?

242
00:16:09,843 --> 00:16:13,138
Malaki na siya, kaya niya na 'yon.
Saka kayo na ni Alex.

243
00:16:13,639 --> 00:16:15,140
Kailangan ako ni Cole.

244
00:16:15,224 --> 00:16:17,893
Talaga ba?
O gusto mo lang na kailanganin ka niya?

245
00:16:18,394 --> 00:16:21,981
-Ano'ng ibig mong sabihin?
-Pumili ka na lang kasi sa kanila.

246
00:16:25,401 --> 00:16:26,402
Sorry.

247
00:16:27,027 --> 00:16:30,948
Sana ganyan lang din ang problema ko.
'Yong di ako makapili ng lalaki.

248
00:16:31,031 --> 00:16:34,368
Pero siyempre wala namang ganap
sa love life ko.

249
00:16:36,662 --> 00:16:38,414
Grace, okay ka lang ba?

250
00:16:38,497 --> 00:16:39,707
Hindi.

251
00:16:41,417 --> 00:16:44,503
Umalis na sa bahay si Papa.
Mukhang magdi-divorce na sila.

252
00:16:45,087 --> 00:16:47,756
-Di ko alam na may pinagdadaanan ka.
-Siyempre di mo alam.

253
00:16:49,133 --> 00:16:50,092
Sorry talaga.

254
00:16:50,175 --> 00:16:51,093
Ayos lang.

255
00:16:51,885 --> 00:16:53,137
Okay lang.

256
00:16:54,138 --> 00:16:57,141
-Aayusin ko pa 'yong pa-raffle.
-Tutulungan na kita.

257
00:16:57,224 --> 00:16:58,809
Wag na, salamat. Kaya ko na 'to.

258
00:17:09,111 --> 00:17:11,655
Di makasalo ang Silver Falls.

259
00:17:15,117 --> 00:17:17,703
Naka-touchdown si Number 37 ng Wolves.

260
00:17:20,164 --> 00:17:22,082
Wolves ball, first down.

261
00:17:26,503 --> 00:17:30,507
Ang lakas ng tackle ni Number 97,
Hughes sa fifty-yard line.

262
00:17:31,884 --> 00:17:36,764
Halftime na, at Aurelita ang lamang.

263
00:17:37,347 --> 00:17:40,726
Kailangang makabawi ng Silver Falls.

264
00:17:42,603 --> 00:17:45,981
Eto na ang special halftime show.

265
00:17:46,065 --> 00:17:50,069
Fans, palakpakan nating lahat
ang cheerleaders

266
00:17:50,152 --> 00:17:52,029
ng Silver Falls Bighorns…

267
00:17:52,112 --> 00:17:53,072
Ayos ka lang ba?

268
00:17:53,906 --> 00:17:54,990
Ano sa tingin mo?

269
00:17:58,077 --> 00:17:59,828
Mas mabuti pa yata kung wala ako dito.

270
00:18:00,621 --> 00:18:04,124
Gaya nga ng sinabi mo,
puppet lang ako ni Allen.

271
00:18:05,167 --> 00:18:06,835
Di ko alam ang ginagawa ko.

272
00:18:08,212 --> 00:18:09,546
So, ano? Susuko ka na lang?

273
00:18:10,756 --> 00:18:11,757
Ikaw nga, sumuko eh.

274
00:18:13,300 --> 00:18:14,885
Oo, pero coach ka.

275
00:18:16,178 --> 00:18:18,055
-Di ko 'to kayang gawin..
-Wow.

276
00:18:18,847 --> 00:18:20,641
Ang dali mo namang sumuko.

277
00:18:21,433 --> 00:18:23,560
Akala mo madali 'tong ginagawa ko?

278
00:18:24,061 --> 00:18:26,897
Akala mo gusto kong maging coach
ng team na ako dati ang leader

279
00:18:26,980 --> 00:18:28,482
habang nasa sidelines?

280
00:18:28,565 --> 00:18:31,485
Habang sinasayang mo
'yong pagkakataon na sana meron ako?

281
00:18:34,571 --> 00:18:35,781
Di ako agad sumusuko.

282
00:18:35,864 --> 00:18:39,952
Pag sumuko na ako,
ibig sabihin ginawa ko na ang lahat.

283
00:18:44,248 --> 00:18:45,165
Tapos ka na ba?

284
00:18:49,086 --> 00:18:49,920
Makinig ka.

285
00:18:50,838 --> 00:18:53,340
Alam kong mahirap
pero magaling kang coach.

286
00:18:53,966 --> 00:18:56,093
Alam ng team 'yon. Dapat alam mo rin 'yon.

287
00:18:57,594 --> 00:19:00,430
Di nila ginagalingan
dahil hinahayaan mo sila.

288
00:19:00,514 --> 00:19:01,849
Etong di ko paglalaro,

289
00:19:03,392 --> 00:19:04,601
makakalimutan nila 'to.

290
00:19:05,602 --> 00:19:06,436
Pero ikaw?

291
00:19:08,355 --> 00:19:10,941
Hindi. Mataas ang tingin nila sa 'yo.

292
00:19:12,234 --> 00:19:13,652
Kailangan ka nila.

293
00:19:15,237 --> 00:19:19,741
Siguradong may isang papanagutin sa 'tin
sa kahihinatnan ng team ngayon.

294
00:19:32,963 --> 00:19:34,047
Kaya mo 'yan, Coach.

295
00:19:41,013 --> 00:19:41,847
Uy, guys!

296
00:19:43,015 --> 00:19:45,225
Guys! Makinig kayo.

297
00:19:46,101 --> 00:19:48,270
Makinig kayong lahat.

298
00:19:48,353 --> 00:19:50,063
Uy! Ano ba?

299
00:19:50,689 --> 00:19:51,899
Tahimik!

300
00:19:52,733 --> 00:19:54,902
Palakpakan natin ang team cheerleaders…

301
00:19:54,985 --> 00:19:57,529
Okay, makinig kayo.

302
00:19:58,906 --> 00:20:01,742
Alam kong di madali ang laban.

303
00:20:01,825 --> 00:20:02,951
-Totoo.
-Kaya nga.

304
00:20:03,577 --> 00:20:04,536
Pero matibay tayo.

305
00:20:06,163 --> 00:20:08,290
Di eto ang pinakamatindi nating game.

306
00:20:08,373 --> 00:20:11,543
Pero halatang natatakot tayo
at ramdam 'yon ng kalaban.

307
00:20:11,627 --> 00:20:13,837
Dahil umatras na
'yong pag-asa nating manalo.

308
00:20:13,921 --> 00:20:15,631
Hayaan n'yo na siya. Okay?

309
00:20:15,714 --> 00:20:17,925
Walang ibang responsable
sa performance ng team

310
00:20:18,008 --> 00:20:20,802
kung di ang players na nandito ngayon.

311
00:20:20,886 --> 00:20:23,847
Marami akong masasayang
memories sa team na 'to,

312
00:20:23,931 --> 00:20:25,807
so alam kong kaya natin 'to.

313
00:20:25,891 --> 00:20:26,975
Kabisado ko kayo.

314
00:20:27,851 --> 00:20:31,563
Jay, Dante, pag nagtutulungan kayo,
sobrang husay n'yo.

315
00:20:31,647 --> 00:20:33,023
Inaasahan namin kayo.

316
00:20:33,774 --> 00:20:37,611
TJ, mabilis kang tumakbo,
walang makakahabol sa 'yo.

317
00:20:37,694 --> 00:20:39,988
Kayong lahat, part kayo ng isang team.

318
00:20:41,615 --> 00:20:42,699
Team ko kayo.

319
00:20:43,909 --> 00:20:47,287
Tayo ang Bighorns.
Ipakita natin sa kanila kung sino tayo!

320
00:20:48,538 --> 00:20:50,707
-Malinaw?
-Yes, Coach.

321
00:20:50,791 --> 00:20:53,126
-Ang sabi ko, malinaw ba?
-Yes, Coach!

322
00:20:55,587 --> 00:20:56,421
Okay!

323
00:20:57,589 --> 00:20:59,675
Jay, game na. Pangunahan mo na.

324
00:21:00,968 --> 00:21:02,177
Bighorns on three!

325
00:21:02,261 --> 00:21:03,887
One, two, three, Bighorns!

326
00:21:03,971 --> 00:21:05,555
Let's go, boys!

327
00:21:08,850 --> 00:21:09,685
Uy.

328
00:21:10,560 --> 00:21:13,188
Isipin mo naglalaro lang kayo ni Parker.

329
00:21:13,272 --> 00:21:14,606
-Okay?
-Okay.

330
00:21:14,690 --> 00:21:15,899
-Okay?
-Okay!

331
00:21:21,405 --> 00:21:23,949
Uy. Okay ka lang dito?

332
00:21:25,033 --> 00:21:26,410
Sige. Eto na.

333
00:21:27,995 --> 00:21:30,580
-Si Grace ba?
-Mukhang nagalit talaga siya sa 'kin.

334
00:21:30,664 --> 00:21:32,207
Alam mo ba 'yong sa parents niya?

335
00:21:32,291 --> 00:21:33,375
Oo, kakasabi niya lang.

336
00:21:33,458 --> 00:21:36,545
-Sana nagsabi siya agad sa 'tin.
-Ganyan talaga si Grace.

337
00:21:37,045 --> 00:21:39,798
Di siya palakuwento ng problema
o palahingi ng tulong.

338
00:21:40,674 --> 00:21:42,801
Palagi lang siyang nakangiti.

339
00:21:44,428 --> 00:21:45,595
Nagi-guilty ako.

340
00:21:45,679 --> 00:21:49,057
Dahil sa mga ganap
sa 'min nina Nathan at Zach,

341
00:21:49,141 --> 00:21:51,268
puro sarili ko lang rin ang iniisip ko.

342
00:21:51,351 --> 00:21:53,103
Kailangan nating bumawi sa kanya.

343
00:21:54,021 --> 00:21:55,063
Eto na.

344
00:21:55,647 --> 00:21:56,773
Kaya nga.

345
00:21:58,358 --> 00:22:01,069
Okay, cowboy. Ang ganda ng ride mo.

346
00:22:01,153 --> 00:22:03,238
Oo, confident na din ako sa ride ko.

347
00:22:04,072 --> 00:22:05,490
Ano'ng reaction ng papa mo?

348
00:22:06,408 --> 00:22:07,409
Pasok ka na.

349
00:22:07,951 --> 00:22:08,952
Talaga?

350
00:22:12,247 --> 00:22:13,457
Ibig sabihin nito,

351
00:22:14,333 --> 00:22:15,542
teammates na tayo.

352
00:22:17,002 --> 00:22:19,129
Gusto mo bang mag-celebrate
kasama 'yong iba?

353
00:22:21,381 --> 00:22:22,799
Di na, salamat.

354
00:22:22,883 --> 00:22:26,011
Magkikita pa kami ni Jackie sa Sparkle.

355
00:22:26,094 --> 00:22:28,013
Okay. Enjoy.

356
00:22:30,057 --> 00:22:30,932
Bye.

357
00:22:31,892 --> 00:22:32,768
Bye.

358
00:22:36,521 --> 00:22:38,607
Two, three, Buffalo Run!

359
00:22:41,777 --> 00:22:46,406
Pasok ang extra points.
Bumabawi ang Silver Falls.

360
00:22:49,368 --> 00:22:52,162
-Ganyan nga!
-Lamang na ang Silver Falls.

361
00:22:54,998 --> 00:22:58,293
Okay! Isaac, kaya mo 'yan. Let's go!

362
00:22:59,252 --> 00:23:02,672
Pumasok na ulit si Garcia sa field.
Matinding pressure 'to…

363
00:23:02,756 --> 00:23:05,133
Red 16, Ginger. On two. Ready?

364
00:23:05,217 --> 00:23:06,343
Break!

365
00:23:09,513 --> 00:23:11,723
Red 16.

366
00:23:11,807 --> 00:23:12,849
Ngayon na! Hut!

367
00:23:19,022 --> 00:23:21,817
Pinasa na! Nasalo niya!

368
00:23:21,900 --> 00:23:22,984
Diretso lang!

369
00:23:24,569 --> 00:23:25,779
Go, Isaac!

370
00:23:25,862 --> 00:23:28,740
Nakalampas na siya sa 20-yard line,
sa 10-yard line.

371
00:23:29,866 --> 00:23:33,370
Touchdown para sa Silver Falls!

372
00:23:33,453 --> 00:23:36,748
Effective ang game play
ni Assistant Coach Cole Walter.

373
00:23:37,332 --> 00:23:38,917
Nagawa nila.

374
00:23:41,086 --> 00:23:43,422
-Let's go.
-Iba ka talaga, Cole!

375
00:23:43,505 --> 00:23:45,382
Grabe ka, Cole! Good job, Coach!

376
00:23:45,465 --> 00:23:49,845
Isaac!

377
00:23:51,847 --> 00:23:53,098
Oh my God.

378
00:23:54,808 --> 00:23:55,934
Okay. Mamaya na lang.

379
00:23:58,937 --> 00:24:02,441
Alam mo na ba? Panalo sila.
Naka-touchdown si Isaac. Tumawag si Danny.

380
00:24:02,524 --> 00:24:04,609
-Talaga? Ang galing naman!
-Oo.

381
00:24:20,750 --> 00:24:23,837
Jacks, one nonalcoholic mulled wine.

382
00:24:23,920 --> 00:24:25,130
Thanks.

383
00:24:32,512 --> 00:24:34,639
May gagawin pa nga pala ako.

384
00:24:37,767 --> 00:24:38,602
Hi.

385
00:24:39,102 --> 00:24:41,271
Hi, Nathan. Kumusta?

386
00:24:43,356 --> 00:24:44,649
Okay lang.

387
00:24:45,442 --> 00:24:46,276
Good.

388
00:24:49,529 --> 00:24:51,490
Gustong makipagbalikan sa 'yo ni Zach,

389
00:24:51,573 --> 00:24:53,325
kaya niya ginawa ang lahat ng 'to.

390
00:24:53,825 --> 00:24:55,994
Wala talaga siyang gusto sa 'kin.

391
00:24:56,077 --> 00:24:58,288
Binalaan na kita sa kanya.

392
00:24:58,371 --> 00:25:01,208
Magaling mangmanipula ng tao si Zach.

393
00:25:02,125 --> 00:25:04,169
Di ko alam kung ano'ng nangyari.

394
00:25:05,587 --> 00:25:06,796
Sorry, Sky.

395
00:25:06,880 --> 00:25:08,006
Alam ko naman.

396
00:25:09,799 --> 00:25:11,843
-Di mo intensiyong saktan ako.
-Di talaga.

397
00:25:11,927 --> 00:25:15,305
Pero hinayaan mo pa rin akong masaktan

398
00:25:15,388 --> 00:25:18,433
dahil lang may ibang nakapansin sa 'yo.

399
00:25:25,649 --> 00:25:30,362
Skylar, ikaw 'yong kauna-unahang
nagparamdam sa 'king special ako.

400
00:25:31,821 --> 00:25:34,991
Pero parang dapat mag-effort pa rin ako
para lang magustuhan mo ako,

401
00:25:35,534 --> 00:25:36,618
para maging tayo.

402
00:25:36,701 --> 00:25:40,830
Feeling ko, di mo ako gusto
gaya ng pagkagusto ko sa 'yo.

403
00:25:41,873 --> 00:25:45,835
Pero si Zach,
pinaramdam niyang gusto niya ako.

404
00:25:45,919 --> 00:25:48,797
Di excuse sa ginawa mo
'yong pagiging insecure mo.

405
00:25:48,880 --> 00:25:49,714
Alam ko.

406
00:25:51,216 --> 00:25:52,050
Alam ko 'yon.

407
00:25:52,592 --> 00:25:54,553
Pero, Sky, di ko 'yon sinasadya, okay?

408
00:25:55,303 --> 00:25:56,805
-Subukan ulit natin…
-Ano?

409
00:25:57,556 --> 00:25:59,099
Tayong dalawa? Di…

410
00:26:00,559 --> 00:26:01,393
Sky.

411
00:26:03,186 --> 00:26:04,145
Mahal kita.

412
00:26:07,899 --> 00:26:08,858
Alam mo?

413
00:26:10,527 --> 00:26:11,820
Mukhang mahal pa rin kita.

414
00:26:14,072 --> 00:26:16,074
Pero di na yata kita kayang pagkatiwalaan.

415
00:26:19,411 --> 00:26:21,454
Ayoko na uling masaktan.

416
00:26:21,538 --> 00:26:22,956
Pero di na mauulit 'yon…

417
00:26:25,208 --> 00:26:26,084
Sky.

418
00:26:28,169 --> 00:26:29,212
Sorry.

419
00:26:57,115 --> 00:26:57,949
Grace?

420
00:27:02,412 --> 00:27:04,497
Sorry talaga.

421
00:27:05,290 --> 00:27:08,084
Di ko alam
na may mabigat kang pinagdadaanan.

422
00:27:08,168 --> 00:27:09,919
-Ayos lang.
-Di okay 'yon.

423
00:27:10,003 --> 00:27:12,005
Puro sarili ko na lang ang iniisip ko.

424
00:27:12,088 --> 00:27:14,507
-Di sa gano'n.
-Ayos lang.

425
00:27:14,591 --> 00:27:15,717
'Yon ang totoo.

426
00:27:15,800 --> 00:27:17,927
Saka gusto kong magpasalamat

427
00:27:18,720 --> 00:27:19,721
sa lahat-lahat.

428
00:27:20,680 --> 00:27:22,599
Salamat sa dance playlist,

429
00:27:22,682 --> 00:27:25,101
sa pagsama para puntahan 'yong bands,

430
00:27:25,185 --> 00:27:27,395
sa pagsuporta sa pop-up,

431
00:27:27,479 --> 00:27:29,856
at sa pagpilit sa 'king tumakbo
as class president.

432
00:27:29,939 --> 00:27:30,774
Oo.

433
00:27:31,399 --> 00:27:34,319
Dahil sa 'yo nagawa ko 'yong mga 'yon.

434
00:27:37,238 --> 00:27:43,328
Saka salamat kasi nilibre mo ako
ng ice cream no'ng first day of school.

435
00:27:44,996 --> 00:27:47,582
Wala 'yon.
Plano ko rin namang bumili no'n.

436
00:27:51,044 --> 00:27:53,171
Di ka nagsasabi pag may problema ka.

437
00:27:54,130 --> 00:27:57,467
-Wala namang may pakialam.
-Di 'yan totoo.

438
00:27:58,176 --> 00:27:59,219
May pakialam ako.

439
00:28:00,053 --> 00:28:01,554
Ganoon din si Skylar.

440
00:28:02,889 --> 00:28:04,891
Grace, ang bait-bait mong friend.

441
00:28:04,974 --> 00:28:07,185
Di man lang kita naa-appreciate.

442
00:28:08,770 --> 00:28:09,604
Na…

443
00:28:10,939 --> 00:28:13,566
Nakakalungkot 'yong nangyari
sa parents mo.

444
00:28:15,402 --> 00:28:16,736
Ano'ng maitutulong ko?

445
00:28:17,821 --> 00:28:18,905
Nakatulong ka na.

446
00:28:22,617 --> 00:28:24,619
Magbabago na ako, okay?

447
00:28:25,161 --> 00:28:27,580
Saka babawi ako sa 'yo.

448
00:28:27,664 --> 00:28:30,709
Mag-shopping tayo next week.

449
00:28:30,792 --> 00:28:34,170
Pumunta ka sa bahay tapos mag-pizza tayo.

450
00:28:36,673 --> 00:28:39,134
Gusto ko 'yan. Salamat.

451
00:28:41,428 --> 00:28:44,305
Sa ngayon, isasakay kita diyan.

452
00:28:47,600 --> 00:28:49,894
Pambata lang 'yan, Jackie.

453
00:28:49,978 --> 00:28:51,896
Ano naman? Tara na.

454
00:28:51,980 --> 00:28:53,022
Diyos ko po.

455
00:28:53,523 --> 00:28:54,983
Pwede ba kaming sumakay?

456
00:28:56,025 --> 00:28:58,403
-Okay, ready?
-Tatalon ka para makasakay ka.

457
00:29:12,792 --> 00:29:14,502
Jackie, halika.

458
00:29:19,799 --> 00:29:20,633
Ano 'yon?

459
00:29:20,717 --> 00:29:22,385
Nagawa ko. Pasok ako sa sponsorship.

460
00:29:22,469 --> 00:29:24,095
-Talaga? Ang galing mo!
-Oo.

461
00:29:25,680 --> 00:29:28,725
Wait, Alex. Ano'ng ginagawa mo?
Baka may makakita sa 'tin.

462
00:29:29,392 --> 00:29:34,189
Di ko gets kung bakit natin 'to nililihim.
Bakit bawal 'tong malaman ng iba?

463
00:29:34,272 --> 00:29:38,777
Di pa 'to ang oras.
Mamaya na natin 'to pag-usapan, okay?

464
00:29:38,860 --> 00:29:41,404
Pero proud na proud ako sa 'yo.

465
00:29:41,905 --> 00:29:42,822
Totoo 'yon.

466
00:29:55,460 --> 00:29:56,294
Uy.

467
00:29:58,588 --> 00:29:59,714
Uy.

468
00:30:01,257 --> 00:30:02,300
Congratulations.

469
00:30:07,639 --> 00:30:09,182
Bakit di ka lumalapit do'n?

470
00:30:09,265 --> 00:30:10,433
Hiwalay na kami.

471
00:30:11,643 --> 00:30:13,561
-Nagkamali ako.
-Paano?

472
00:30:14,896 --> 00:30:16,564
Saka bakit di ko alam 'to?

473
00:30:16,648 --> 00:30:20,151
Dahil mali-mali 'yong pinagsasabi ko.
Ano pa nga ba?

474
00:30:21,611 --> 00:30:23,988
Saka madalas kang wala sa bahay lately.

475
00:30:25,198 --> 00:30:27,158
Okay, una sa lahat,

476
00:30:28,493 --> 00:30:29,869
gusto ka ni Erin.

477
00:30:30,495 --> 00:30:34,916
Okay? Pangalawa, wag mong isiping
di ka pwedeng maging honest sa kanya.

478
00:30:34,999 --> 00:30:35,875
Talaga ba?

479
00:30:36,876 --> 00:30:39,963
Pinapayuhan ako ni Cole Walter
na maging honest sa girls?

480
00:30:40,046 --> 00:30:42,632
Tama ka. Maling magpayo ako.

481
00:30:44,509 --> 00:30:45,677
Except dito.

482
00:30:48,137 --> 00:30:50,348
Wag mo siyang susukuan
nang di ka nag-e-effort.

483
00:31:12,412 --> 00:31:14,163
Bilisan mo!

484
00:31:15,248 --> 00:31:18,585
May snowflake ornaments ako do'n.
Gawa ko 'yon.

485
00:31:20,295 --> 00:31:21,504
Oo.

486
00:31:30,221 --> 00:31:31,306
Sige. Salamat.

487
00:31:36,185 --> 00:31:37,896
Congratulations, panalo kayo.

488
00:31:38,938 --> 00:31:39,856
Di ako naglaro.

489
00:31:41,024 --> 00:31:44,360
-Bakit?
-Gusto kong magdesisyon para sa sarili ko.

490
00:31:46,821 --> 00:31:48,990
So di ka na kasama sa showcase?

491
00:31:49,073 --> 00:31:50,491
Paano 'yong papa mo?

492
00:31:50,575 --> 00:31:53,536
Ewan ko. Aalamin ko pa.

493
00:31:55,788 --> 00:31:57,874
Pero di 'yon ang mahalaga ngayon.

494
00:31:57,957 --> 00:32:00,668
Ang mahalaga, tama ka.

495
00:32:01,753 --> 00:32:03,004
Saan ako tama?

496
00:32:04,297 --> 00:32:08,801
Hi, everybody. Welcome. Salamat sa pagdalo
sa Silver Falls Sparkle.

497
00:32:14,474 --> 00:32:17,769
Eto na ang Silver Falls Sparkler Awards.

498
00:32:17,852 --> 00:32:19,938
Dapat panagutan ko 'yong pagkakamali ko.

499
00:32:20,021 --> 00:32:21,940
At aayusin…

500
00:32:22,857 --> 00:32:24,776
Aayusin ko 'to, okay?

501
00:32:26,110 --> 00:32:27,236
Alam ko naman.

502
00:32:28,404 --> 00:32:30,865
So lagi ka nang makikinig
kasi lagi akong tama.

503
00:32:32,492 --> 00:32:34,827
This year, first time nating

504
00:32:35,411 --> 00:32:38,039
mamimigay ng Young Sparkler Award

505
00:32:38,122 --> 00:32:41,626
na ni-nominate
ng Silver Falls High junior students.

506
00:32:43,670 --> 00:32:45,630
Para 'to sa pagtulong niya sa school,

507
00:32:45,713 --> 00:32:48,925
gaya ng pagsalba
sa muntik maudlot na Fall Formal,

508
00:32:49,008 --> 00:32:50,802
at sa pag-iimbita sa college reps

509
00:32:50,885 --> 00:32:54,013
sa buong bansa
para i-meet ang Silver Falls students.

510
00:32:54,764 --> 00:32:55,974
Jackie Howard!

511
00:32:56,808 --> 00:32:58,434
Jackie, halika rito.

512
00:32:59,936 --> 00:33:02,814
-Go, Jackie!
-Deserve mo 'yan, Jackie!

513
00:33:05,191 --> 00:33:06,359
Go, girl!

514
00:33:08,027 --> 00:33:08,861
Wait.

515
00:33:12,907 --> 00:33:15,243
-Alam mo ba 'to?
-Go, girl!

516
00:33:15,326 --> 00:33:18,121
Palakpakan nating lahat

517
00:33:18,204 --> 00:33:21,082
ang ating Silver Falls Sparklers!

518
00:33:29,132 --> 00:33:33,052
Wala akong ibang kakilalang
kagaya mo, Kiley.

519
00:33:33,136 --> 00:33:35,471
Puro cheerleaders kasi ang kasama mo.

520
00:33:35,555 --> 00:33:38,433
Wait, pakinggan mo muna ako.
May sasabihin ako.

521
00:33:40,601 --> 00:33:41,477
Okay.

522
00:33:42,145 --> 00:33:46,149
Finally, eto na
ang pinakahihintay nating lahat.

523
00:33:46,232 --> 00:33:48,359
Masaya kang kasama, Kiley.

524
00:33:57,076 --> 00:34:00,705
Sa tingin ko, baliw na 'ko sa 'yo.

525
00:34:01,414 --> 00:34:03,291
Baliw ka naman talaga.

526
00:34:13,176 --> 00:34:14,594
Oh my God.

527
00:34:17,388 --> 00:34:18,306
Ayos.

528
00:34:22,602 --> 00:34:23,644
Dumating sila.

529
00:34:23,728 --> 00:34:25,646
-Pinilit nila kaming pakainin…
-Erin?

530
00:34:31,778 --> 00:34:32,612
Makinig ka.

531
00:34:33,321 --> 00:34:36,949
Ayos lang kung ayaw mo akong
maging part ng future mo.

532
00:34:37,033 --> 00:34:38,534
-Ayos lang talaga.
-Hindi…

533
00:34:39,118 --> 00:34:40,119
Di gano'n 'yon.

534
00:34:42,080 --> 00:34:43,664
Ang babata pa kasi natin,

535
00:34:43,748 --> 00:34:46,667
at mukhang magkaiba tayo ng pangarap.

536
00:34:47,168 --> 00:34:48,711
Alam kong magsa-succeed ka.

537
00:34:49,212 --> 00:34:51,839
Abutin mo 'yong pangarap mo.
Ganoon din ako.

538
00:34:53,341 --> 00:34:54,175
Oo.

539
00:34:54,258 --> 00:34:56,177
Ayokong pigilan ka sa pangarap mo.

540
00:34:56,260 --> 00:34:57,970
Di ganoon ang tingin ko sa 'yo.

541
00:34:58,054 --> 00:35:02,141
Tama ka, magkaiba tayo ng pangarap,

542
00:35:02,225 --> 00:35:03,226
pero ayos lang 'yon.

543
00:35:06,104 --> 00:35:08,564
Mag-enjoy na lang muna tayo ngayon.

544
00:35:09,398 --> 00:35:11,859
Saka na natin problemahin ang future.

545
00:35:12,985 --> 00:35:14,070
Gusto ko 'yan.

546
00:35:15,780 --> 00:35:16,614
Sige.

547
00:35:17,406 --> 00:35:18,324
Okay.

548
00:35:55,027 --> 00:35:55,862
Hinga.

549
00:35:55,945 --> 00:35:56,779
Uy!

550
00:35:59,198 --> 00:36:00,616
One, two, three.

551
00:36:04,495 --> 00:36:05,371
Thanks, Terry.

552
00:36:06,247 --> 00:36:07,165
Cheers.

553
00:36:10,042 --> 00:36:12,128
Oh, hi! Patingin ng medal mo.

554
00:36:12,211 --> 00:36:13,212
Sige.

555
00:36:15,339 --> 00:36:17,091
Deserve mo 'tong award na 'to.

556
00:36:17,842 --> 00:36:18,801
Well.

557
00:36:19,302 --> 00:36:24,348
Alam kong di naging madali sa 'yo
'tong mga nakaraang buwan

558
00:36:25,683 --> 00:36:29,020
pero part ka na ng community na 'to
at ng pamilya namin.

559
00:36:30,938 --> 00:36:32,648
Salamat, pumayag kang bumalik dito.

560
00:36:33,691 --> 00:36:36,110
Salamat, pinilit mo akong bumalik dito.

561
00:36:36,194 --> 00:36:38,196
Natutuwa ako na okay na ang lahat.

562
00:36:38,279 --> 00:36:40,990
Pakiramdam ko normal na ulit ang lahat.

563
00:36:50,458 --> 00:36:51,626
Ayan na siya.

564
00:36:51,709 --> 00:36:52,543
Sandali lang.

565
00:36:54,629 --> 00:36:56,672
Jackie, congrats sa award.

566
00:36:57,465 --> 00:36:58,299
Salamat.

567
00:36:59,258 --> 00:37:00,760
Ikaw ba ang nag-nominate sa 'kin?

568
00:37:01,260 --> 00:37:02,386
Hindi.

569
00:37:03,179 --> 00:37:04,972
Secret 'yon na bawal kong sabihin.

570
00:37:11,938 --> 00:37:14,523
Tumakbo kang
Student Council President next year.

571
00:37:14,607 --> 00:37:19,070
Ayoko. Tumakbo na ako as Junior Class
President. Nakita mo naman ang resulta.

572
00:37:19,153 --> 00:37:21,280
Alam ng lahat
kung sino ang dapat nanalo do'n.

573
00:37:22,198 --> 00:37:26,285
Anyways, madali kang mananalo
as Student Council President

574
00:37:26,369 --> 00:37:29,622
dahil ikaw ang gagawin kong VP
next semester.

575
00:37:31,082 --> 00:37:32,875
-Pwede mong gawin 'yon?
-Oo.

576
00:37:35,127 --> 00:37:36,003
Salamat.

577
00:37:36,671 --> 00:37:37,713
Deserve mo 'yon.

578
00:37:38,464 --> 00:37:41,342
Good. Nakaka-proud ka.

579
00:37:41,425 --> 00:37:43,261
Tingnan natin kung ano'ng mangyayari.

580
00:37:47,932 --> 00:37:48,766
Hi.

581
00:37:51,352 --> 00:37:52,186
Hi.

582
00:37:55,648 --> 00:37:57,149
Dito na muna ako…

583
00:37:58,943 --> 00:38:00,528
Uy, Erin, sandali.

584
00:38:01,279 --> 00:38:02,530
Congratulations.

585
00:38:02,613 --> 00:38:04,573
Salamat.

586
00:38:06,993 --> 00:38:08,536
-Congrats din.
-Salamat.

587
00:38:11,497 --> 00:38:12,498
Masaya ka ba?

588
00:38:13,916 --> 00:38:14,750
Oo.

589
00:38:16,294 --> 00:38:20,464
-Ang sarap na sa pakiramdam na manalo.
-Mabuti kung gano'n.

590
00:38:27,179 --> 00:38:28,180
Kita…

591
00:38:30,433 --> 00:38:32,560
Kita na lang tayo sa bahay. Okay?

592
00:38:35,396 --> 00:38:36,230
Okay.

593
00:38:46,907 --> 00:38:49,243
Ang hirap no'ng tanggapin.

594
00:38:50,578 --> 00:38:53,289
Nagpakahirap ako sa project na 'yon.

595
00:38:54,123 --> 00:38:55,791
Gusto kong mag-succeed 'yon.

596
00:38:57,501 --> 00:39:00,755
Feeling ko magsa-succeed 'yon.
Pero wala na 'yon ngayon.

597
00:39:01,714 --> 00:39:03,466
Pinatigil 'yon ni Papa.

598
00:39:03,549 --> 00:39:04,383
Oo nga, eh.

599
00:39:06,260 --> 00:39:08,012
Ano na'ng gagawin ko?

600
00:39:10,598 --> 00:39:15,019
'Yong farm kung saan ako nag-stay,
nasa gitna ng kawalan 'yon.

601
00:39:15,102 --> 00:39:18,856
Sa tents kami natutulog.
Minsan walang kuryente

602
00:39:18,939 --> 00:39:20,983
o kaya nagkakaubusan ng pagkain.

603
00:39:21,067 --> 00:39:23,819
So umaasa kaming
may parating ng supply trucks.

604
00:39:23,903 --> 00:39:26,614
-Oo nga. Ang lala no'n.
-Hindi.

605
00:39:26,697 --> 00:39:28,491
Hindi. Ang saya nga, eh.

606
00:39:29,575 --> 00:39:32,745
Maliban no'ng three days barado
'yong banyo. 'Yon ang malala.

607
00:39:32,828 --> 00:39:34,663
Pero madalas, masaya kami.

608
00:39:37,083 --> 00:39:41,837
Doon ko nakita
na marami pa tayong di nararanasan.

609
00:39:44,548 --> 00:39:49,678
Baka masyadong maliit 'tong bayan na 'to
para sa matataas mong pangarap?

610
00:40:02,566 --> 00:40:04,527
-Danny, go.
-Ituturo ko sa 'yo ang C chord.

611
00:40:04,610 --> 00:40:07,571
-C chord?
-'Yon ang pinakamadaling chord.

612
00:40:07,655 --> 00:40:10,199
-Ikaw na.
-Nakakapag-ollie nga ako, eh.

613
00:40:11,784 --> 00:40:14,787
-Uy, Jackie, upo ka dito.
-Sige, salamat.

614
00:40:14,870 --> 00:40:16,539
Bakit di ka na lang mag-ollie?

615
00:40:18,165 --> 00:40:21,961
Pwede ba kitang interviewhin
para sa People of Influence assignment ko?

616
00:40:22,044 --> 00:40:23,879
-Sige, Jordan.
-Thanks.

617
00:40:24,672 --> 00:40:26,048
Hanggang saan ang matututunan…

618
00:40:26,132 --> 00:40:29,385
So, pumasa ka na sa driving test mo…

619
00:40:30,177 --> 00:40:33,013
Personal driver mo na 'ko,
gaya ng pinangako ko sa 'yo.

620
00:40:33,931 --> 00:40:35,391
-Okay.
-May two ka ba?

621
00:40:36,183 --> 00:40:37,685
Uy, guys, nandito ba si Mama?

622
00:40:37,768 --> 00:40:40,312
-May biglaan siyang work.
-Eh si Papa?

623
00:40:40,396 --> 00:40:42,940
-Nasa top field siya.
-Nang ganitong oras?

624
00:40:43,023 --> 00:40:44,775
Oo, kaninang hapon pa siya doon.

625
00:40:45,651 --> 00:40:48,487
Thanks. Uy, congrats nga pala.

626
00:40:49,238 --> 00:40:51,365
Naa-appreciate ko kayo. Lahat kayo.

627
00:40:53,117 --> 00:40:57,121
Speaking of congrats, natanggap na ni Cole
'yong new SAT scores niya.

628
00:40:57,705 --> 00:40:59,582
Cole? Ano'ng score mo?

629
00:41:00,374 --> 00:41:02,001
Mga 1250 lang.

630
00:41:02,084 --> 00:41:04,545
Ang galing mo.
Kailan mo pa 'yon natanggap?

631
00:41:04,628 --> 00:41:05,671
Few weeks ago.

632
00:41:05,754 --> 00:41:07,423
Pero akala ko ba…

633
00:41:12,052 --> 00:41:13,762
Bakit di mo sinabi sa 'kin?

634
00:41:14,346 --> 00:41:17,183
Mag-celebrate lang kayo dito.

635
00:41:17,266 --> 00:41:18,476
Lalabas muna ako.

636
00:41:28,110 --> 00:41:28,944
Cole?

637
00:41:31,822 --> 00:41:32,781
Ayos ka lang ba?

638
00:41:34,575 --> 00:41:35,409
Ayos lang ako.

639
00:41:38,162 --> 00:41:40,080
Pwedeng itigil na natin 'to?

640
00:41:40,789 --> 00:41:42,166
Alam kong may problema.

641
00:41:43,501 --> 00:41:45,294
Ilang linggo ka nang ganyan.

642
00:41:45,377 --> 00:41:47,630
Iniiwasan mo ako,
lagi kang umaalis ng bahay,

643
00:41:47,713 --> 00:41:49,924
tapos gagawa dapat tayo
ng college applications

644
00:41:50,007 --> 00:41:52,343
pero nilihim mong
nakuha mo na ang SAT scores mo.

645
00:41:53,135 --> 00:41:55,679
Please lang, tapatin mo na 'ko.

646
00:41:57,264 --> 00:42:00,226
Ikaw 'tong di tapat.

647
00:42:00,309 --> 00:42:02,186
Ano'ng ibig mong sabihin?

648
00:42:02,269 --> 00:42:04,104
Tapat ako sa 'yo, noon pa man.

649
00:42:04,188 --> 00:42:06,732
Kahit yata sarili mo, di mo matapat.

650
00:42:07,233 --> 00:42:08,275
Okay, Cole.

651
00:42:09,818 --> 00:42:10,653
Okay.

652
00:42:11,654 --> 00:42:13,030
Tatapatin na kita.

653
00:42:15,533 --> 00:42:16,909
Nakita ko kayo ni Alex

654
00:42:18,160 --> 00:42:19,245
sa bahay ni Richard.

655
00:42:23,082 --> 00:42:24,041
Alam mo,

656
00:42:24,542 --> 00:42:27,253
binigyan kita ng space
dahil 'yon ang pakiusap mo.

657
00:42:27,753 --> 00:42:29,129
Akala ko may something tayo.

658
00:42:29,213 --> 00:42:32,508
So di ko maunawaan
kung bakit kayo na naman ng kapatid ko.

659
00:42:32,591 --> 00:42:35,344
Ang usapan natin, magiging friends tayo.

660
00:42:35,427 --> 00:42:36,929
Di lang tayo magkaibigan.

661
00:42:37,012 --> 00:42:38,597
Cole, di 'to…

662
00:42:39,723 --> 00:42:41,350
-Si Alex at ako…
-Ano?

663
00:42:41,934 --> 00:42:45,771
Bakit di mo siya maiwasan,
pero ang dali sa 'yong iwasan ako?

664
00:42:47,773 --> 00:42:51,819
Di kita kayang iwasan, okay?

665
00:42:52,778 --> 00:42:55,948
Kahit pilitin ko, di ko magawa.

666
00:42:56,448 --> 00:42:58,284
Pero hindi pwede, Cole.

667
00:42:58,367 --> 00:43:03,163
Kailangan kong pigilan
'yong nararamdaman ko pag kasama kita.

668
00:43:03,789 --> 00:43:05,916
-Ano'ng nararamdaman mo sa 'kin?
-Tama na.

669
00:43:06,000 --> 00:43:08,252
Mahal kita, Jackie.

670
00:43:09,878 --> 00:43:13,549
Akala ko mahal mo rin ako.
Sana naman sabihin mo kung mali ako.

671
00:43:21,265 --> 00:43:22,433
Mahal kita.

672
00:43:23,267 --> 00:43:24,310
Okay?

673
00:43:24,393 --> 00:43:26,729
Tapos na ba 'to? Pwede na ba akong umalis?

674
00:43:26,812 --> 00:43:29,106
Bakit parang ayaw na ayaw mo
akong makasama?

675
00:43:32,484 --> 00:43:33,736
Bakit?

676
00:43:34,695 --> 00:43:36,697
No'ng nag-kiss tayo,

677
00:43:36,780 --> 00:43:41,118
'yon 'yong unang beses
na parang huminto ako sa pag-iisip

678
00:43:41,201 --> 00:43:46,123
sa pag-aaral ko, sa pakikisama
sa mga tao dito, at sa magiging future ko.

679
00:43:46,206 --> 00:43:48,334
Pakiramdam ko, malaya ako,

680
00:43:49,418 --> 00:43:54,048
out of control ako.
Di ako pwedeng maging gano'n, Cole.

681
00:43:54,131 --> 00:43:56,842
Di pwedeng out of control ako.

682
00:43:57,509 --> 00:43:58,344
Bakit?

683
00:43:59,803 --> 00:44:00,721
Kasi…

684
00:44:03,098 --> 00:44:05,434
di ko alam ang mangyayari pag gano'n.

685
00:44:13,609 --> 00:44:14,860
Mahal mo siya?

686
00:44:18,447 --> 00:44:19,490
Alex…

687
00:44:25,537 --> 00:44:27,289
Ano'ng nangyayari?

688
00:44:28,957 --> 00:44:30,209
Si papa.

689
00:45:24,680 --> 00:45:27,891
Nagsalin ng Subtitle:
Lei Diane Dimaano

690
00:45:28,891 --> 00:45:43,891
